(1428, 14, '4. THE FINAL ACCOUNTS OF A SOLE TRADER', '4.1 Trading, profit and loss accounts/Income statement', 'Preparation of trading and profit and loss accounts. Trading account shows gross profit/loss. Profit and loss account shows net profit/loss.', 'trading account, profit and loss account, income statement, gross profit, gross loss, net profit, net loss, cost of sales, opening stock, purchases, closing stock, sales, revenue, expenses'),
(1429, 14, '4. THE FINAL ACCOUNTS OF A SOLE TRADER', '4.2 Balance sheet/statement of financial position', 'Preparation of balance sheet showing financial position. Assets, liabilities, capital at a point in time.', 'balance sheet, statement of financial position, assets, non-current assets, fixed assets, current assets, liabilities, non-current liabilities, long-term liabilities, current liabilities, capital, owner\'s equity, net worth, financial position'),
(1430, 14, '4. THE FINAL ACCOUNTS OF A SOLE TRADER', '4.3 Adjustments to final accounts', 'Adjustments for accruals, prepayments, depreciation, bad debts, provisions, etc. Year-end adjustments.', 'final accounts adjustments, adjusting entries, accruals, accrued expenses, prepayments, prepaid expenses, depreciation, bad debts, provision for doubtful debts, provision for discounts, outstanding expenses, income received in advance'),
(1431, 14, '5. PROVISIONS AND RESERVES', '5.1 Provision for doubtful debts/Allowance for doubtful debts', 'Creating and adjusting provision for doubtful debts. Estimated uncollectible amounts from debtors.', 'provision for doubtful debts, allowance for doubtful debts, bad debts provision, doubtful accounts, debtors, accounts receivable, uncollectible amounts, adjusting entries, percentage of debtors, aging schedule'),
