(1433, 14, '5. PROVISIONS AND RESERVES', '5.3 Depreciation – concepts, reasons for recording', 'Meaning and need for charging depreciation. Allocation of cost of fixed assets over useful life.', 'depreciation concepts, depreciation reasons, allocation of cost, fixed assets, non-current assets, wear and tear, obsolescence, passage of time, depletion, matching concept'),
