(1435, 14, '5. PROVISIONS AND RESERVES', '5.5 Depreciation methods - reducing balance', 'Reducing balance method of calculating depreciation. Fixed percentage on reducing balance. Higher charge in early years.', 'reducing balance method, diminishing balance method, declining balance method, fixed percentage, written down value, WDV, higher early charge, accelerated depreciation'),
(1436, 14, '5. PROVISIONS AND RESERVES', '5.6 Depreciation methods - sum of the years digits', 'Sum of years digits method of calculating depreciation. Fraction based on remaining life.', 'sum of years digits method, SYD method, accelerated depreciation, remaining life fraction, year digit sum'),
(1437, 14, '5. PROVISIONS AND RESERVES', '5.7 Depreciation methods - revaluation', 'Revaluation method of calculating depreciation. Annual valuation, depreciation = opening value - closing value + additions - disposals.', 'revaluation method, valuation method, annual valuation, opening value, closing value, additions, disposals, depreciation charge'),
