(6631, 145, 'Which of the following statements on the use of X-rays is incorrect? X-rays are used', 'In a hospital to obtain photographs of tissues and bones in the body', 'For the treatment of malignant growths like cancer cells', 'In detecting fingerprints', 'To reveal hidden flaws in metal castings and welded joints work of art', 'C'),
(6632, 145, 'Natural radioactivity consists of emission?', 'α particles and β-rays', 'α particles and X-rays', 'γ-ray and X-rays', 'α particles and β-rays and γ-rays', 'D'),
