(6731, 5, 'The equation of a wave traveling along the positive x- direction is given by; y = 0.25×10^-3 sin (500t - 0.025x). Determine the angular velocity of the wave motion.', '0.25×10^-3 rad/s', '0.25×10^-1 rad/s', '5.00×10^2 rad/s', '2.50×10^3 rad/s', 'C'),
