(6736, 5, 'The velocities of light in air and glass are 3.0×10^8ms-1 and 2.0×10^8ms-1 respectively. If the angle of refraction is 30°, the sine of the angle of incidence is?', '0.33', '0.50', '0.67', '0.75', 'D'),
