(8020, 68, 'In determining the growth of a country\'s population, infant mortality is a component of', 'Immigration rate', 'Fertility rate', 'Net migration', 'Death rate', 'D'),
(8021, 68, 'The low productivity per worker in agriculture experienced in West African countries is due to', 'Laziness on the part of farmers', 'The use of simple traditional implements', 'The presence of many extension workers', 'The law of increasing returns to scale', 'B'),
