(8023, 68, 'Locating firms in urban areas', 'Reduce rural-urban migration', 'Ensure balanced development of rural areas', 'Make a firm enjoy the benefits of the existence of other firms', 'Increase urban-rural migration', 'C'),
(8024, 68, 'An advantage a small firm has over a large firm is that the former can better', 'Enjoy financial economies of scale', 'Satisfy individual tastes', 'Enjoy internal economies of scale', 'Attract huge discounts on inputs', 'B'),
