(8026, 68, 'Use the table below to answer this question. Gross National Product: $400m, Depreciation: $100m, Total Population: 25m. The value of Net National Product is', '$100m', '$275m', '$300m', '$500m', 'C'),
(8027, 68, 'Use the table below to answer this question. Gross National Product: $400m, Depreciation: $100m, Total Population: 25m. The value of per capita income is', '$20', '$12', '$16', '$4', 'B'),
(8028, 68, 'One effect of inflation is that', 'Money\'s purchasing power will increase', 'The real incomes of workers will rise', 'Both borrowers and lenders benefit from it', 'Money\'s purchasing power will fall', 'D'),
(8029, 68, 'The function of money that enables credit purchases of goods and services is', 'Unit of account', 'Store of value', 'Standard for deferred payment', 'Relative scarcity', 'C'),
(8030, 68, 'Supply of money is best defined as the', 'Money in circulation plus bank deposits', 'Money given out as loans to members of the public', 'Amount of currency printed annually by the government', 'Amount of money spent on consumer goods', 'A'),
(8031, 68, 'Capital market operators deal in the', 'Supply of and demand for short term loans only', 'Supply of and demand for long term loans for investment', 'Sales and purchases of treasury bills', 'Sales and purchases of capital equipment', 'B'),
(8032, 68, 'Money supply will increase when the Central Bank', 'Buys securities from the public', 'Increases the reserve requirements', 'Increases the bank rate', 'Sells securities to the public', 'A'),
(8033, 68, 'Terms of trade is favourable when the', 'Value of visible imports is greater than that of visible exports', 'Price on imports is greater than that of exports', 'Payments on imports is greater than receipts from exports', 'Price of exports is rising faster than that of imports', 'D'),
