(8051, 69, 'A firm\'s average cost decreases in the long-run because of', 'Increasing returns to scale', 'Diminishing average returns', 'Decreasing average fixed cost', 'Decreasing marginal returns', 'A'),
(8052, 69, 'What is the median term in the distribution below; 14, 13, 29, 15, 13, 17, 12.', '14', '13', '15', '12', 'A'),
(8053, 69, 'The following are types of business organization EXCEPT', 'Co-operative society', 'Partnership', 'Entrepreneurship', 'Public corporation', 'C'),
(8054, 69, 'The contribution of petroleum to the economy of Nigeria is most prominent in the area of', 'Revenue generation', 'Infrastructural development', 'Fuel provision', 'Employment generation', 'A'),
(8055, 69, 'Which of the following is NOT a feature of capitalism?', 'Free enterprise', 'Private ownership of property', 'Competition', 'Detailed economic planning', 'D'),
(8056, 69, 'When an economy is having a balance of payment surplus the best alternative opened to it is to', 'Devalue its currency', 'Borrow from abroad', 'Promote imports into the country', 'Increase its foreign reserve', 'D'),
